@startuml
title Available-player picker
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator opens selected active team's roster;
:Request available players for team;
if (Team exists and is not archived?) then (yes)
  :Find team's season and sport;
  :Start with active player profiles;
  :Exclude players assigned to an active team\nin the same sport and season;
  :Return remaining players to dropdown;
else (no)
  :Return an error;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Assignments in another sport or season, or to an
  archived team, do not block availability. Submission
  is checked again by the add-player service.
endlegend
@enduml
